network SecretModel ⟦
    dense ⟬2⸴ 4⟭ ·
    relu ·
    dense ⟬4⸴ 1⟭ ·
⟧

process main⦅⦆ → int64 ⟦
    ethical_boundary auth1 ⟦
        rule access ↦ 1.0 ·
    ⟧

    ethical_boundary auth2 ⟦
        rule access ↦ 1.0 ·
    ⟧

    vault v with auth1 ⟬ SecretModel ⟭ threshold ↦ 3 ·
    seal v ·
    emit "Vault sealed with auth1" ·

    // Attacker tries to unseal with auth2
    unseal v with auth2 ·
    emit "Unreachable" ·

    yield 0 ·
⟧
